# Tier-a embedded posture: safety-critical checks on, style delegated to
# clang-format.
Checks: >
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  readability-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -readability-magic-numbers
WarningsAsErrors: "bugprone-*,clang-analyzer-*"
FormatStyle: file
